WEBVTT

01:36.320 --> 01:38.280
The moon is finally out.

01:40.760 --> 01:42.800
Let's make mooncakes

01:43.960 --> 01:45.480
and celebrate Mid-Autumn Festival.

01:50.320 --> 01:51.600
Starting today,

01:52.440 --> 01:56.000
let's all work hand in hand
for the brocade.

01:58.400 --> 02:00.840
Whether we're in Yizhou or Nanzhao,

02:00.920 --> 02:03.440
we all look at the same moon.

02:04.560 --> 02:06.200
Since we can't send our letters,

02:08.120 --> 02:09.960
we shall let the moon carry our longing.

02:15.280 --> 02:17.480
Let the moon carry our longing.

02:17.560 --> 02:19.720
Let the moon carry our longing.

02:33.000 --> 02:35.200
A-Alright then, let's celebrate!

02:35.280 --> 02:37.480
If you know how to make mooncakes,
join me and Pin to make some.

02:37.560 --> 02:39.640
If you love lanterns,
come to me to get one.

02:39.720 --> 02:40.920
- Here.
- Alright.

02:41.000 --> 02:42.480
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

02:54.000 --> 02:55.360
Here you go.

02:59.160 --> 03:01.960
Back home, mooncake-making
is a much more elaborate affair.

03:02.560 --> 03:05.280
We have three pastry chefs
just for the dough

03:05.360 --> 03:07.280
and five chefs just for the filling.

03:08.400 --> 03:10.120
Take the dough, for example.

03:10.200 --> 03:12.840
It needs to be folded 81 times.

03:13.600 --> 03:16.080
Each fold gets a layer of lard.

03:16.160 --> 03:18.440
That is how we get that perfectly flaky
and savory mooncake.

03:20.160 --> 03:21.160
When we return,

03:21.240 --> 03:23.720
the first thing I will do
is to take you home

03:23.800 --> 03:25.760
to try our special mooncakes.

03:35.400 --> 03:36.560
Go on.

03:44.880 --> 03:46.200
A-Also, the fillings…

03:46.720 --> 03:47.640
The fillings

03:48.160 --> 03:49.920
a-are quite generous too.

03:51.000 --> 03:52.120
Let me say it then.

03:53.640 --> 03:54.560
Shisi,

03:55.120 --> 03:56.480
I like you.

04:12.160 --> 04:13.040
I…

04:27.320 --> 04:28.640
Can you be a little more gentle?

04:29.680 --> 04:30.520
I…

04:35.800 --> 04:38.000
You weren't exactly the man
I would like to marry.

04:38.880 --> 04:40.920
I do not know when it all began,

04:42.400 --> 04:44.160
but thoughts of you always make me smile.

04:47.120 --> 04:48.800
When I feel scared,

04:49.680 --> 04:51.640
I cannot help but think of your name.

04:55.040 --> 04:56.440
Sang Shisi,

04:59.200 --> 05:00.040
I like you.

05:03.160 --> 05:04.520
No matter what the future holds,

05:05.120 --> 05:06.720
I just want to be with you.

05:25.240 --> 05:26.480
Kiss me!

05:27.800 --> 05:28.840
I can kiss you now?

06:17.480 --> 06:20.640
I want you to keep being yourself.

06:22.280 --> 06:25.880
I want our encounter to be

06:25.960 --> 06:29.160
like a bird finding its kin in the sky,

06:29.800 --> 06:32.680
like one breeze merging with another.

06:33.800 --> 06:36.560
It should make you feel happier, freer,

06:37.240 --> 06:38.360
more unrestrained,

06:39.200 --> 06:40.360
and more vibrant.

06:40.880 --> 06:45.000
But you are not just a bird,
nor just a breeze to me.

06:46.880 --> 06:48.040
You are the moon.

06:52.320 --> 06:57.760
My night has been a long one.
I thought I would walk it alone.

06:59.080 --> 07:01.320
But at some point,

07:01.400 --> 07:04.440
every time I looked up,
the moon was there.

07:05.680 --> 07:09.000
Through the harsh storms and biting frost,
through its ever-changing phases,

07:09.080 --> 07:10.760
it has always been there.

07:11.480 --> 07:14.840
He once told me that
he would always have my back.

07:23.080 --> 07:24.160
You are so sly.

07:31.960 --> 07:33.600
Because I want to live.

07:38.640 --> 07:40.680
Can I buy one mooncake?

07:46.200 --> 07:48.400
We don't sell the ones we make ourselves.

07:49.480 --> 07:51.760
They are for family and friends.

07:54.960 --> 07:56.520
What is this? Is it for me?

08:00.920 --> 08:01.960
Thank you.

08:10.440 --> 08:11.720
It is pretty good!

08:15.000 --> 08:16.520
My master once said
that Mid-Autumn Festival

08:17.120 --> 08:20.360
is the perfect time to appreciate the moon
and think of our families.

08:23.360 --> 08:26.000
What else did your master say?
Share it with me.

08:26.680 --> 08:30.240
Well, he never said
that the women of Yizhou are this cunning.

08:33.039 --> 08:34.720
Let me ask you. How do you find Yizhou?

08:37.039 --> 08:39.320
To me, it is the best place.

08:39.840 --> 08:41.480
I grew up there.

08:42.000 --> 08:44.120
My family and friends are there.

08:46.000 --> 08:48.360
If you are so curious,
why don't you go see it for yourself?

08:50.360 --> 08:52.400
Who said I was curious? I am not curious.

08:53.000 --> 08:56.080
You wear Nanzhao's clothes,
but you study Yizhou's silk.

08:57.880 --> 09:00.720
That is because you like it,
and you are curious.

09:02.480 --> 09:05.120
Wait! How do you know everything?

09:05.200 --> 09:07.680
You… Do you have
some kind of Yizhou voodoo?

09:10.280 --> 09:14.400
Only someone with a clear mind
can create such vibrant color.

09:19.360 --> 09:21.200
I was raised by the people of Yizhou,

09:21.280 --> 09:24.320
but in the end,
I am still the child of Nanzhao.

09:25.320 --> 09:27.200
Even if I wanted to visit Yizhou,
I couldn't.

09:33.680 --> 09:36.080
Your clothes are different
from everyone else's

09:36.680 --> 09:38.680
because you combined
the weaving and dyeing technique

09:38.760 --> 09:40.320
from Nanzhao and Yizhou.

09:41.560 --> 09:44.760
Yizhou and Nanzhao
do not need to always be at odds

09:44.840 --> 09:45.880
or live in battle.

09:46.640 --> 09:49.840
Like your clothes,
we can communicate, blend,

09:50.440 --> 09:51.520
and become friends.

10:02.200 --> 10:05.120
This is a sachet I made myself.

10:05.720 --> 10:06.880
It repels mosquitoes.

10:08.600 --> 10:10.120
It is a gift for a friend.

10:22.720 --> 10:24.000
It is a gift from Yang Jinglan.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.280
Have you seen him?

10:38.200 --> 10:39.440
Where is he?

10:39.960 --> 10:41.360
How is he doing?

10:42.440 --> 10:43.760
He is still alive.

10:47.080 --> 10:49.760
He asked me to pass on a message to you.

10:50.360 --> 10:52.040
I am safe. Don't worry.

11:04.840 --> 11:06.800
These are the mooncakes we just made.

11:07.320 --> 11:09.560
All from Yizhou will get one.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.960
It's okay.

11:15.280 --> 11:16.520
My entire family

11:17.400 --> 11:18.960
was killed by Niu Jin.

11:20.360 --> 11:22.480
There may never be a reunion for me

11:24.320 --> 11:25.840
in this lifetime.

11:59.840 --> 12:00.880
Yaoting,

12:01.880 --> 12:02.920
Mother,

12:04.480 --> 12:06.400
please be safe.

12:07.760 --> 12:08.880
Wait for me.

12:11.440 --> 12:12.720
Wait for us.

12:15.360 --> 12:16.760
Yang Jinglan and I

12:18.880 --> 12:20.600
will definitely return.

12:25.680 --> 12:26.800
Yingying,

12:28.160 --> 12:29.680
don't think it's ugly.

12:31.680 --> 12:33.160
The one I gave you

12:34.880 --> 12:36.520
is already the finest of the lot.

12:44.520 --> 12:46.480
I want to tell my moon this.

12:47.840 --> 12:51.680
After everything is over,
if he still longs to see the world,

12:52.600 --> 12:54.240
then I will join him
to explore its wonders.

13:36.280 --> 13:37.320
Mr. Yang,

13:38.360 --> 13:39.320
how is it?

13:40.680 --> 13:41.920
How do you feel?

13:43.600 --> 13:45.280
Who would have thought

13:46.560 --> 13:48.080
Prince Bai

13:48.960 --> 13:50.400
would resort to using drugs?

13:55.680 --> 13:56.640
Well,

13:57.400 --> 13:58.680
I know

13:58.760 --> 14:02.400
torture would not work
on someone like you,

14:03.080 --> 14:05.840
so I had no choice

14:06.560 --> 14:10.680
but to take a more unconventional approach
to get you to talk.

14:13.600 --> 14:15.280
What do you want to know?

14:15.800 --> 14:17.440
My plans?

14:21.320 --> 14:22.480
Would you believe it

14:23.720 --> 14:25.040
even if I tell you?

14:41.400 --> 14:42.600
My plan…

14:43.920 --> 14:45.240
is for you…

14:47.880 --> 14:49.360
to send me away…

14:50.200 --> 14:51.200
by yourself…

15:01.200 --> 15:02.240
Yang Jinglan,

15:04.440 --> 15:05.640
do not forget

15:06.320 --> 15:08.880
that you are now in Nanzhao.

15:09.520 --> 15:11.000
No matter how you scheme,

15:11.080 --> 15:14.120
you will not be able
to escape from my grasp.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.200
Her eyes

15:34.960 --> 15:36.640
should carry a hint of a smile.

15:40.360 --> 15:41.920
Her wrists

15:43.280 --> 15:44.640
should be slender

15:45.400 --> 15:46.360
and delicate.

15:46.440 --> 15:47.280
Let go.

15:47.360 --> 15:49.760
- It does not look like her at all!
- Let go!

15:57.240 --> 16:00.240
Do you feel like there are
millions of ants crawling all over you?

16:00.320 --> 16:02.560
As if they are eating into you?
Biting you?

16:04.040 --> 16:06.840
There will come a day
when you are not able to bear the pain

16:06.920 --> 16:08.880
and drink that cup of drug.

16:08.960 --> 16:09.920
By then,

16:10.000 --> 16:13.920
you will let go of your dignity
and beg me!

16:23.200 --> 16:24.640
Do you think that I am

16:25.920 --> 16:26.880
Zhao Xiuyuan?

16:26.960 --> 16:29.040
Yes! So what if I do?

16:30.920 --> 16:32.760
Inside this dark, hopeless room,

16:32.840 --> 16:34.640
you will only be accompanied by the drugs!

16:34.720 --> 16:36.800
No matter how steely your resolve,
it will still shatter

16:36.880 --> 16:39.000
under its own weight!

16:51.200 --> 16:53.520
Mr. Yang, you…

16:54.160 --> 16:55.800
Take care of yourself.

16:57.880 --> 16:58.880
I will

17:01.200 --> 17:02.880
come and visit you in a few days.

17:09.839 --> 17:10.920
Yingying,

17:11.640 --> 17:12.640
do not be afraid.

17:14.400 --> 17:16.160
I will think of a way out.

17:17.720 --> 17:19.560
I will take you away from this place

17:20.720 --> 17:22.160
and see us back to Yizhou.

17:25.720 --> 17:26.760
Wait for me.

17:38.000 --> 17:38.960
Ting,

17:40.080 --> 17:41.480
must it be you?

17:42.760 --> 17:45.960
You have always been poor with words,
never one to argue with others.

17:46.480 --> 17:49.920
Does it truly have to be you
who goes to stop Niu Jin this time?

17:50.520 --> 17:54.840
Mother, the craftsmen have been taken,
and the brocade industry is in shambles.

17:54.920 --> 17:56.560
Niu Jin has turned a blind eye
to our suffering,

17:56.640 --> 17:57.720
imposing harsh taxes to exploit us further

17:57.800 --> 18:00.080
and demanding
even more Shu brocade as tribute.

18:00.600 --> 18:03.200
If this goes on, the brocade industry
will collapse entirely.

18:03.880 --> 18:06.840
Someone must stand up
and tell him that this cannot continue.

18:07.640 --> 18:09.760
I understand. I understand all of this!

18:10.280 --> 18:11.400
But…

18:11.480 --> 18:13.960
Yingying is in Nanzhao.
We do not know if she is safe.

18:14.040 --> 18:16.320
If something happens to you tomorrow, I…

18:16.400 --> 18:18.600
I will protect him from the shadows.

18:19.640 --> 18:21.920
No. Yuniang, you must not go.

18:22.000 --> 18:25.280
If they capture you,
I will lose all will to do anything else.

18:28.000 --> 18:29.080
Do not worry.

18:29.600 --> 18:31.120
Niu Jin may be ruthless,

18:31.200 --> 18:34.800
but he knows that killing us all
will bring him no gain.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.400
Ting,

18:40.000 --> 18:42.160
you must be careful.

18:43.800 --> 18:45.280
Do not worry, Mother.

18:48.440 --> 18:49.880
I will wait for your return.

18:54.480 --> 18:55.440
Then…

18:55.960 --> 18:58.120
let us drink to the moon,
a toast for the Mid-Autumn Festival.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.600
May all families be reunited

19:01.680 --> 19:02.560
and safe.

19:20.160 --> 19:23.240
THE NIU RESIDENCE

19:23.320 --> 19:26.280
Mr. Zhuge,
the Ji family's brocade has been sent in.

19:26.960 --> 19:28.280
Thank you for your hard work.

19:29.280 --> 19:30.560
Though we have all worked tirelessly,

19:30.640 --> 19:33.600
these brocades will still fall short
for the tribute.

19:34.120 --> 19:36.800
May I accompany Mr. Zhuge
to meet General Niu?

19:36.880 --> 19:38.800
We need someone to speak out,

19:38.880 --> 19:39.720
to show that trading the future
of Yizhou's brocade industry

19:39.800 --> 19:41.360
for short-term gains is a grave mistake.

19:42.080 --> 19:45.400
To be honest, Mr. Zhuge and I
share the same thoughts.

19:45.480 --> 19:47.360
However, before we could enter,

19:47.440 --> 19:49.400
Mr. Yu Shu stopped us.

19:49.480 --> 19:51.200
Mr. Yu went in alone?

19:51.280 --> 19:53.680
Yes. He said
that as long as he is still alive,

19:53.760 --> 19:56.640
this matter should not
be handled by us young ones.

20:01.040 --> 20:03.720
Gentlemen, the commander
has requested your presence inside.

20:18.800 --> 20:21.160
So, Mr. Yu is implying

20:21.960 --> 20:23.680
that I have demanded too much as tribute?

20:25.240 --> 20:27.640
It is not that you
have asked for too much,

20:27.720 --> 20:31.160
but Yizhou has lost too many craftsmen,

20:31.240 --> 20:33.320
and the brocade industry
has been severely impacted.

20:33.920 --> 20:37.040
We are unable to meet your demands
at this time.

20:47.320 --> 20:48.520
Good day, Commander.

20:51.040 --> 20:54.880
Mr. Yu was just telling me

20:55.920 --> 20:58.160
that you are all facing
great difficulty now.

20:58.240 --> 21:01.560
You have lost craftsmen,
and the silk prices have increased.

21:01.640 --> 21:04.160
In short, he suggests

21:04.680 --> 21:06.200
that I have demanded too much tribute.

21:07.720 --> 21:11.240
Commander, they are still young

21:12.160 --> 21:13.640
and lack much life experience.

21:13.720 --> 21:17.520
That is why they cannot foresee

21:17.600 --> 21:18.880
that if this situation continues,

21:18.960 --> 21:20.280
it will be like

21:20.360 --> 21:22.680
killing the goose for its golden eggs.

21:23.200 --> 21:26.320
It is not that we do not want
to pay tribute to you.

21:27.480 --> 21:32.000
In fact, we wish to offer our tribute
for the long-term.

21:32.560 --> 21:36.240
That is why we hope you can show mercy
and grant us some respite.

21:36.320 --> 21:38.160
A gentle stream never runs dry.

21:39.960 --> 21:41.520
I did not ask you.

21:42.120 --> 21:43.480
I was asking them.

21:44.000 --> 21:44.920
What do you think?

21:46.160 --> 21:47.800
I have checked the records.

21:47.880 --> 21:49.120
Throughout history,

21:49.200 --> 21:50.880
Yizhou's brocade industry
has been forced to end five times.

21:50.960 --> 21:52.680
Twice, it was due to war.

21:52.760 --> 21:54.320
As for the other three times…

21:56.560 --> 21:58.440
It's all because the taxes imposed
by the Shu Pass are too high.

22:05.960 --> 22:07.040
What about you two?

22:08.480 --> 22:09.800
Please forgive me, Commander.

22:10.320 --> 22:12.840
Even after my family gave it our all,
working day and night,

22:12.920 --> 22:14.920
we were unable to meet your request.

22:19.480 --> 22:21.040
Had it been
when the industry was at its peak,

22:21.120 --> 22:22.560
we might have been able to fulfill it.

22:22.640 --> 22:23.600
However…

22:24.120 --> 22:27.040
the industry has been severely impacted,
and we simply cannot do it now.

22:40.160 --> 22:42.840
To be honest, you should all know

22:43.440 --> 22:45.480
that I have many ways to make money.

22:45.560 --> 22:48.920
Why would I focus on Shu brocade?

22:51.160 --> 22:55.160
It is because when I was younger,
my family was very poor.

22:55.680 --> 22:56.720
My parents died young,

22:57.440 --> 22:59.800
and my brother and I were left
to survive on our own.

22:59.880 --> 23:02.440
We worked for a wealthy family together.

23:03.040 --> 23:08.040
One day, my brother accidentally dirtied
the madam's brocade dress,

23:09.080 --> 23:10.800
and he was beaten to death.

23:13.400 --> 23:17.520
From that moment on,
I swore that if I ever became rich,

23:19.120 --> 23:21.960
I would clothe myself in fine brocade

23:22.560 --> 23:25.200
and make the brocade industry
my source of entertainment.

23:35.040 --> 23:37.320
Alright, enough of that.
I was just reminiscing about the past.

23:38.000 --> 23:38.880
Fine.

23:39.400 --> 23:42.040
Since you all think
I have asked for too much,

23:42.120 --> 23:44.400
I am not an unreasonable man.

23:45.840 --> 23:47.960
This will be the full tribute
for this year.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.080
Thank you, Commander.

23:55.320 --> 23:56.720
- Mr. Yu!
- Mr. Yu!

24:02.840 --> 24:04.800
I was not done speaking earlier.

24:06.920 --> 24:10.160
The reason
I want to be dressed in fine brocade

24:10.720 --> 24:11.880
is because

24:12.800 --> 24:15.160
I do not tolerate
those who speak against me

24:15.240 --> 24:16.280
regarding it.

24:24.840 --> 24:27.720
Next time,
it must be no less than today's tribute.

24:27.800 --> 24:29.360
And you should speak less as well.

24:33.640 --> 24:34.840
- Mr. Yu.
- Mr. Yu.

24:50.360 --> 24:51.880
My family…

24:54.120 --> 24:55.320
Xi…

24:56.360 --> 24:57.560
Do not worry, Mr. Yu.

24:58.080 --> 25:01.440
As long as we are here,
we will watch over the Yu family.

25:05.200 --> 25:06.360
Do not be afraid.

25:08.880 --> 25:10.800
There is still a long road ahead.

25:15.840 --> 25:17.080
Mr. Yu!

25:41.800 --> 25:43.480
This is not over.

25:44.920 --> 25:46.160
We must be prepared for what's to come.

25:59.920 --> 26:02.360
These are the reports
from the Qingping Officer.

26:03.000 --> 26:04.320
You should have a look.

26:04.400 --> 26:05.760
PRINCE BAI MURDERED YIZHOU'S
COMMANDER, MU HUI

26:12.400 --> 26:15.400
I did not kill Commander Mu!
I am being framed by Niu Jin!

26:20.560 --> 26:22.160
I implore you
to investigate this thoroughly.

26:22.920 --> 26:25.320
Regardless of whether
the accusation is true or not,

26:25.400 --> 26:30.960
Mu Hui's old troops invading our borders
under the guise of revenge is real.

26:32.120 --> 26:35.760
The whispers of the commoners
and their fear are real!

26:36.360 --> 26:38.040
Please allow me some time

26:38.120 --> 26:39.760
to get to the bottom of this
and uncover the truth.

26:40.800 --> 26:41.720
Your Majesty,

26:41.800 --> 26:43.800
this cannot be delayed any longer!

26:44.720 --> 26:47.240
The Tang army
is directly challenging our forces,

26:47.320 --> 26:50.520
claiming they will invade Nanzhao's city.

26:51.040 --> 26:55.040
They will treat our people the same way
Prince Bai treated Nanzhao's people.

26:55.120 --> 26:58.280
If we wait any longer,
the people will begin to flee.

26:58.360 --> 27:01.760
By then,
Nanzhao will descend into utter chaos.

27:09.160 --> 27:12.480
The Tang army is stirring trouble
under the pretext of revenge.

27:13.400 --> 27:17.880
I fear that you are now
in the greatest danger.

27:19.400 --> 27:20.560
How about this?

27:21.480 --> 27:23.400
You will move into my palace.

27:23.480 --> 27:25.040
It is nestled
between the mountains and the sea,

27:25.120 --> 27:26.680
far from many people.

27:26.760 --> 27:28.120
It is easy to defend but hard to attack.

27:28.640 --> 27:33.240
I will also send troops ahead
to keep watch day and night

27:33.760 --> 27:35.480
to ensure your safety.

27:41.880 --> 27:44.640
I have one more person
who can prove my innocence.

27:55.800 --> 27:57.720
Mu Hui's old troops!

27:57.800 --> 27:59.560
There are no such people!

27:59.640 --> 28:01.120
You were behind all of this!

28:08.000 --> 28:09.640
Given Niu Jin's character,

28:09.720 --> 28:12.520
those people are either
his men now or dead.

28:13.040 --> 28:16.040
There cannot be so many
who would come to Nanzhao for revenge.

28:18.560 --> 28:19.840
Indeed.

28:22.040 --> 28:24.520
Why did you not tell your emperor that?

28:25.800 --> 28:27.520
Because he does not see it as important.

28:28.680 --> 28:29.880
He does not want

28:30.400 --> 28:31.800
the truth.

28:33.080 --> 28:34.440
He wants results.

28:43.200 --> 28:48.360
What will you offer me
if I can stop the chaos at the borders?

29:05.120 --> 29:07.160
I have two questions.

29:07.240 --> 29:10.960
First, how do you plan to achieve that?

29:11.040 --> 29:12.200
Second,

29:12.280 --> 29:15.360
who are the ones stirring up trouble
at the borders?

29:20.840 --> 29:22.320
Give me a bowl of clean water.

30:05.160 --> 30:07.080
They are just

30:07.760 --> 30:09.600
some of my old friends.

30:09.680 --> 30:11.600
I will tell them

30:12.400 --> 30:15.040
that Niu Jin is the true mastermind
behind Yizhou's situation.

30:15.120 --> 30:17.000
Then, I will ask them to head to Chang'an

30:17.680 --> 30:19.120
and urge the government

30:19.640 --> 30:21.240
to deal with Niu Jin.

30:26.040 --> 30:27.280
At this point,

30:29.720 --> 30:31.240
you can only trust me.

30:39.200 --> 30:40.440
Fine!

30:40.520 --> 30:41.720
Tell me, then.

30:41.800 --> 30:43.920
What… do you want?

30:47.080 --> 30:48.520
I want to bring one person with me.

30:52.760 --> 30:54.440
She has not completed her brocade.

30:54.520 --> 30:55.520
She will not leave with you.

30:56.120 --> 30:59.800
The root cause of this incident
will be decided by Chang'an.

31:00.440 --> 31:02.160
Shang Shisi is the Imperial Uncle,

31:03.200 --> 31:04.480
and within Chang'an,

31:05.000 --> 31:06.360
his claims carry more weight than mine.

31:07.880 --> 31:09.680
The things the crown prince cannot do,

31:10.200 --> 31:13.400
his sister and brothers can accomplish.

31:14.960 --> 31:17.560
Fine. I will agree to that.

31:18.240 --> 31:19.280
Second.

31:20.040 --> 31:25.200
I need you to write a letter
admitting to working with Niu Jin.

31:25.920 --> 31:28.320
You can write whatever you need
to protect yourself,

31:28.840 --> 31:32.760
but I want the government to know that
you had a private relationship with him.

31:37.600 --> 31:41.040
Fine. I can do that.

31:41.960 --> 31:43.120
Third.

31:44.240 --> 31:45.680
Before I leave,

31:46.960 --> 31:48.640
I want to see my wife.

32:02.280 --> 32:04.160
- Fourth.
- Fourth?

32:04.680 --> 32:05.960
Mr. Yang,

32:06.520 --> 32:09.240
do you not reckon
you are asking for a bit too much?

32:10.080 --> 32:11.200
Fourth.

32:11.880 --> 32:14.480
You are not to lay a finger
on Ji Yingying for the span of one year.

32:15.240 --> 32:17.360
This is not a deal
between Yizhou's brocade officer

32:17.440 --> 32:19.560
and Nanzhao's Prince Bai.

32:20.120 --> 32:22.240
This is a deal between men.

32:26.000 --> 32:27.240
Have you the courage to strike it?

32:39.720 --> 32:40.800
I…

32:43.480 --> 32:44.520
promise you.

33:17.640 --> 33:18.760
Uh…

33:18.840 --> 33:20.040
How many times have I told you?

33:20.640 --> 33:22.800
You are only supposed to put the silk in
when the water is boiling.

33:22.880 --> 33:24.600
Why did you put it in early again?

33:25.120 --> 33:26.320
Just look at that!
Does that color look right to you?

33:30.960 --> 33:33.320
Are you a blockhead?

33:34.480 --> 33:36.280
This is not Yizhou silk.

33:36.360 --> 33:38.480
It has to be dyed
using the Nanzhao method.

33:38.560 --> 33:39.520
Do you not understand that?

33:39.600 --> 33:41.200
Or are you hard of hearing,
or are you just a moron?

33:41.280 --> 33:43.560
I am not a moron!
And I am not hard of hearing!

33:43.640 --> 33:44.760
Shu brocade! It's Shu brocade!

33:44.840 --> 33:46.800
Of course, you have to dye it
using the Shu method!

33:46.880 --> 33:49.480
You are making Nanzhao brocade
with Nanzhao silk!

33:49.560 --> 33:51.360
You must follow Nanzhao's methods!

33:51.440 --> 33:53.480
Does Nanzhao even have
any decent silk or brocade?

33:53.560 --> 33:54.560
- Use the Nanzhao method?
- Of course, there is! I dyed it myself!

33:54.640 --> 33:57.480
I make fine silk!
I take excellent care of those silkworms!

33:57.560 --> 33:58.760
Please do not argue.

33:58.840 --> 34:01.040
I have just designed a new pattern.

34:01.120 --> 34:04.200
It will need both Shu and Nanzhao colors.

34:04.280 --> 34:08.320
Perhaps you both can give it a try
and let the results speak for themselves.

34:08.400 --> 34:09.239
- Deal!
- Deal!

34:09.320 --> 34:10.639
Just you wait!

34:11.480 --> 34:14.199
I will show you the difference
between true craftsmen and blockheads.

34:15.239 --> 34:16.440
Blockhead!

34:18.760 --> 34:21.280
Hey! Yingying,
look at that despicable Nanzhao woman!

34:21.360 --> 34:23.639
I tried so hard to be polite
and chivalrous!

34:23.719 --> 34:25.600
- Look!
- This is an exchange of techniques.

34:25.679 --> 34:27.360
A few arguments are to be expected.

34:28.920 --> 34:29.840
Fine.

34:30.600 --> 34:32.400
I will engage
in a constructive exchange with her.

34:40.560 --> 34:41.440
Yingying,

34:43.600 --> 34:45.239
can we work together on the brocade?

34:50.960 --> 34:51.800
Sure.

34:52.840 --> 34:55.360
We can leave the past behind for now.

34:55.440 --> 34:57.240
Let's focus on the brocade,
so we can return home.

35:00.840 --> 35:01.960
I will get back to designing
the new pattern.

35:02.840 --> 35:03.720
Thank you.

35:12.040 --> 35:13.080
Ms. Ji,

35:14.280 --> 35:15.520
someone is asking for you.

35:16.040 --> 35:17.080
This way, please.

35:38.320 --> 35:40.160
I said I would let you see her,

35:40.680 --> 35:42.760
but I never said
how you would go about it.

35:53.800 --> 35:54.880
Ms. Ji.

36:31.560 --> 36:35.280
This Rippling Grain Brocade
was made for you.

36:36.560 --> 36:38.680
I keep the promises I made.

36:40.320 --> 36:41.840
A lifetime is a lifetime.

36:43.120 --> 36:44.320
For better or for worse,

36:45.320 --> 36:46.600
I will never leave you behind.

37:14.320 --> 37:16.520
I will not leave you.
I will not forget my heart.

37:17.840 --> 37:20.520
No matter what happens from here on out,

37:21.040 --> 37:23.440
you and I will not lose each other.

37:44.360 --> 37:45.720
Mr. Yang,

37:46.480 --> 37:47.560
make haste.

37:47.640 --> 37:49.360
It is time you leave.

38:38.240 --> 38:41.440
STATION WANGXING

38:46.640 --> 38:47.520
Gentlemen,

38:48.120 --> 38:51.400
after this stop, you will be
in the Tang Empire's territory.

38:52.040 --> 38:56.400
From here on,
your fate will be in your own hands.

38:57.000 --> 38:58.240
- Farewell.
- Hey!

38:58.920 --> 38:59.960
Hey! You…

39:01.720 --> 39:02.560
You!

39:05.800 --> 39:06.760
Given the current situation,

39:06.840 --> 39:08.680
they have decided to stay out of it

39:08.760 --> 39:10.360
now that you have managed to drive
the invaders away from their borders.

39:10.440 --> 39:12.280
Why are the people of Nanzhao
so treacherous?

39:12.360 --> 39:13.320
Are they even human?

39:14.720 --> 39:15.760
Shisi,

39:16.280 --> 39:19.560
we will have to continue
the rest of the journey on our own.

39:20.760 --> 39:21.680
Are you scared?

39:23.800 --> 39:25.080
I must press on, even if fear grips me.

39:25.160 --> 39:26.680
I have promised Pin

39:26.760 --> 39:29.440
I will bring them home
safely and in style.

39:30.960 --> 39:32.880
Mr. Yang, you are far cleverer than I am.

39:33.480 --> 39:35.440
I will follow your lead
for the journey ahead.

39:35.520 --> 39:36.440
You need not worry about me.

39:37.360 --> 39:38.520
Just keep me alive.

39:40.520 --> 39:41.480
Do not worry.

39:45.680 --> 39:46.680
Yang Jinglin?

39:49.560 --> 39:50.640
Why are you here?

39:52.160 --> 39:53.720
Why are you being so rude?

39:53.800 --> 39:55.400
You addressed me by my full name?

39:56.600 --> 39:58.040
Fine! Tell me this.

39:58.120 --> 40:00.480
You are now a fugitive.

40:00.560 --> 40:02.840
There are countless obstacles ahead.

40:02.920 --> 40:04.440
How do you plan to reach Chang'an?

40:06.840 --> 40:09.360
So… You have a plan?

40:10.320 --> 40:12.760
Now you remember me?

40:12.840 --> 40:14.240
Fine, I will tell you.

40:14.320 --> 40:16.840
The moment
we learned you left for Nanzhao,

40:16.920 --> 40:18.480
Father assembled a team of merchants.

40:18.560 --> 40:21.600
We have been waiting
at the station between both borders.

40:22.200 --> 40:25.160
The moment you arrive,
we will set off for Chang'an.

40:26.240 --> 40:27.400
By the way,

40:29.840 --> 40:31.360
this is the new identity
we have prepared for you.

40:31.880 --> 40:33.080
Keep it safe!

40:36.760 --> 40:38.160
Traveling with a fugitive?

40:38.680 --> 40:41.320
Are you not worried
about being dragged into this mess?

40:43.280 --> 40:45.840
I know everything you have done.

40:46.360 --> 40:48.920
You are truly a member of the Yang family!
I respect you.

40:49.000 --> 40:50.840
But I am also a Yang.

40:51.360 --> 40:53.520
I have also been taught
the values of loyalty and filial piety.

40:54.040 --> 40:56.920
Yizhou is not just your home.

40:57.440 --> 40:58.640
It is mine as well.

40:59.160 --> 41:00.160
Who would not want to return home?

41:01.720 --> 41:02.560
Very well.

41:02.640 --> 41:06.200
Let us all head to Chang'an
and return home together.

41:07.000 --> 41:08.520
Come! Let us go home!

41:08.600 --> 41:10.040
- Let's go!
- Come on!

41:21.000 --> 41:23.920
This is the brocade
woven with the finest silk we have.

41:24.560 --> 41:26.520
Next, we will have you test

41:26.600 --> 41:28.880
if it can be crafted
into an acceptable Nanzhao brocade.

41:39.160 --> 41:42.480
The pattern is clear, the colors sharp,
and the flower perfectly formed.

41:43.000 --> 41:44.080
There is no flaw in its weave.

42:01.800 --> 42:03.200
The color does not fade in salt water.

42:03.280 --> 42:04.560
Its hues remain as sharp as before.

42:04.640 --> 42:05.960
There is no issue with its dye.

42:08.400 --> 42:10.640
I will test its durability.

42:13.240 --> 42:14.320
Let me!

42:14.400 --> 42:16.400
- Let me!
- Be gentle!

42:16.480 --> 42:17.520
- Let me!
- Gentle!

42:19.960 --> 42:22.360
Blockhead,
why did you use so much strength?

42:23.640 --> 42:25.680
We spent months on it.

42:26.720 --> 42:28.200
How could I be careless with it?

42:30.000 --> 42:32.680
Regular brocade
can withstand this level of pulling.

42:34.080 --> 42:35.280
It tore

42:36.280 --> 42:37.840
because we failed once more.

42:39.560 --> 42:40.760
It is still not good enough.

42:43.680 --> 42:45.400
The silk is still not durable enough,

42:45.920 --> 42:47.800
but it is much better
than when we started.

42:47.880 --> 42:48.720
Let us try harder.

42:48.800 --> 42:52.080
We have tried so hard,
yet the outcome is still the same!

42:52.600 --> 42:56.000
Our one-year deadline is nearly up!
If we still cannot make it, we…

42:59.200 --> 43:01.440
I don't even know
what I was hoping for anymore.
